{
 "defe054e-952e-4ab7-b82c-aaf96f3c551a": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$15$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sec^{2}(\\tan^{-1}2)=1+\\tan^{2}(\\tan^{-1}2)=1+4=5$; $\\operatorname{cosec}^{2}(\\cot^{-1}3)=1+\\cot^{2}(\\cot^{-1}3)=1+9=10$।\nযোগফল $=5+10=15$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৯০-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি; $\\sec^{2}=1+\\tan^{2}$, $\\operatorname{cosec}^{2}=1+\\cot^{2}$।\n"
 },
 "086ec30d-6462-4097-b3d8-1d41eca070e4": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\cos x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\operatorname{cosec}x=2$ ⇒ $\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}$; $\\cot x=-\\sqrt{3}$ ⇒ $\\cos x=\\cot x\\cdot\\sin x=-\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cos x=\\cot x\\sin x$; OPT_2 সত্য।\n"
 },
 "d5b832d5-0d47-4464-99ca-3012c97a57b0": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 3,
  "answer_text": "$x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sqrt{3}\\cos x+\\sin x=2\\cos\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=1$ ⇒ $\\cos\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$।\n$0\\leq x\\leq\\frac{\\pi}{2}$-তে $x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right]$; একমাত্র $x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$ ⇒ $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $R=2$, $\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ রূপান্তর; ব্যাপ্তিতে $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$-ই সমাধান।\n"
 },
 "70c72afc-4739-4116-912e-810e22a9df69": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{3}{5}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan(A+B+C)=\\frac{\\tan A+\\tan B+\\tan C-\\tan A\\tan B\\tan C}{1-\\tan A\\tan B-\\tan B\\tan C-\\tan C\\tan A}$।\n$\\tan A=2,\\tan B=3,\\tan C=4$ বসালে:\nলব $=2+3+4-24=-15$; হর $=1-6-12-8=-25$।\n∴ $\\tan\\theta=\\frac{-15}{-25}=\\frac{3}{5}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: তিন কোণের tangent যোগফল সূত্র সরাসরি প্রয়োগ।\n"
 },
 "9d4c39a2-1b17-477c-b230-ddfb95c3214a": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{n \\pi}{4}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan x+\\tan3x=0$ ⇒ $\\tan3x=-\\tan x=\\tan(-x)$\n⇒ $3x=n\\pi-x$ ⇒ $4x=n\\pi$ ⇒ $x=\\frac{n\\pi}{4}$, $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\tan A=\\tan B\\iff A=n\\pi+B$; $\\tan(-x)=-\\tan x$।\n"
 },
 "651841e1-a936-4b51-b5c2-4014bb957126": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{3}{5}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{2+3+4-24}{1-6-12-8}=\\frac{-15}{-25}=\\frac{3}{5}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ৩০৬-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি; তিন-কোণ tan সূত্র।\n"
 },
 "ea19eea5-d825-4388-b440-199693cf17f4": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$0$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin^{-1}x+\\cos^{-1}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ (ধ্রুবক)।\n∴ $\\sin\\left[2\\left(\\sin^{-1}x+\\cos^{-1}x\\right)\\right]=\\sin\\left(2\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=\\sin\\pi=0$ ⇒ $a=0$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: পূরক কোণ identity; $\\sin\\pi=0$।\n"
 },
 "7815873e-464c-4314-a4e2-35fdaee2d341": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$x=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ ⇒ $\\sin^{-1}x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$।\n∴ $2\\sin^{-1}x=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}=\\sin^{-1}y$ ⇒ $y=\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$।\n"
 },
 "5c112621-128c-462a-a700-b7f66277cbe6": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cot^{-1}3=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}$; যোগফল $=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{2}+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}=\\tan^{-1}1=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$; $\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৮৩-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি।\n"
 },
 "6e4c0f95-c71c-4b52-b07f-dc0aedc68280": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$1$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$x=\\sin(\\cos^{-1}y)=\\sqrt{1-y^{2}}$ ⇒ $x^{2}+y^{2}=1$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sin(\\cos^{-1}y)=\\sqrt{1-y^{2}}$; তাই $x^{2}+y^{2}=1$।\n"
 },
 "65e2424b-1ba4-4114-b2b9-64a1d85582fc": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\pi$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan^{-1}2+\\tan^{-1}3=\\pi+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{5}{1-6}=\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$।\n∴ মোট $=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{3\\pi}{4}=\\pi$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৩৯-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি; $xy>1$-এ $\\pi$ যোগ।\n"
 },
 "a6630657-cc82-4ac4-a131-77671f1e9269": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 4,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$x=\\sqrt{2}$ হলে $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$।\n$\\alpha=\\sin^{-1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ ⇒ $\\sin\\alpha=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ ⇒ $\\tan\\alpha=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\nতখন $\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\tan\\alpha\\right)=\\sin^{-1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n∴ $\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sin\\alpha=1/\\sqrt{3}$ থেকে $\\tan\\alpha=1/\\sqrt{2}$; $\\sin^{-1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n"
 },
 "fe6795e2-2b95-4153-851d-dfc0cfdf8969": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin A=\\frac{1}{2}$ ⇒ $\\tan A=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ (1-অতিভুজ, $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$-সন্নিহিত ত্রিভুজ)।\n$\\cos B=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ ⇒ $\\tan B=\\sqrt{2}$ (বিপরীত $\\sqrt{2}$)।\n∴ $\\tan A\\tan B=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ডানকোণী ত্রিভুজ থেকে tan মান; গুণফল $\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$।\n"
 },
 "307c12f8-c5c6-4478-b0d0-cd1fba981fdb": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$7\\sin^{2}\\theta+3\\cos^{2}\\theta=4$; $\\cos^{2}\\theta=1-\\sin^{2}\\theta$ বসিয়ে:\n$7\\sin^{2}\\theta+3-3\\sin^{2}\\theta=4$ ⇒ $4\\sin^{2}\\theta=1$ ⇒ $\\sin^{2}\\theta=\\frac{1}{4}$ ⇒ $\\cos^{2}\\theta=\\frac{3}{4}$ ⇒ $\\sec\\theta=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sec\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$; $\\cos^{2}\\theta=\\frac{3}{4}$।\n"
 },
 "3ea9e667-bbb1-4ca5-a8ff-bec471edf2ac": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$45^{\\circ}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$2\\cos^{2}\\theta+2\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\theta=3$; $\\cos^{2}\\theta=1-\\sin^{2}\\theta$:\n$2-2\\sin^{2}\\theta+2\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\theta=3$ ⇒ $2\\sin^{2}\\theta-2\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\theta+1=0$\n⇒ $(\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\theta-1)^{2}=0$ ⇒ $\\sin\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$ ⇒ $\\theta=45^{\\circ}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: পূর্ণবর্গ; $\\sin45^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$।\n"
 },
 "aecd2d4c-faa7-4617-b423-ce771dc480a0": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 2,
  "answer_text": "$n \\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cos\\theta=0=\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ ⇒ $\\theta=2n\\pi\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ — উভয়কে একত্রে লেখা যায় $\\theta=n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $n$ জোড়জোড়/বিজোড় হলে $2n\\pi\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{2}$-ই মিলে যায়।\n"
 },
 "e019c3e8-3e5a-4653-ba74-692aa08819ef": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 3,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{2 b}{a}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cot\\left(\\tan^{-1}\\frac{a}{b}\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\tan\\left(\\tan^{-1}\\frac{a}{b}\\right)}=\\frac{b}{a}$;\n$\\tan\\left(\\cot^{-1}\\frac{a}{b}\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\cot\\left(\\cot^{-1}\\frac{a}{b}\\right)}=\\frac{b}{a}$।\nযোগফল $=\\frac{b}{a}+\\frac{b}{a}=\\frac{2b}{a}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: পরস্পর reciprocal; দুটি পদ সমান $\\frac{b}{a}$।\n"
 },
 "b5bbb5e6-0fd3-46a1-ab4a-dcd2dc63b96f": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\frac{1}{2}\\sin^{-1}\\frac{2x}{1+x^{2}}=\\tan^{-1}x$ ($|x|\\leq1$-এ)।\n∴ রাশি $=\\tan^{-1}x+\\cot^{-1}x$। $\\cot^{-1}x$-এর মূল মান ব্যাপ্তিতে $\\tan^{-1}x+\\cot^{-1}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ (x>0)।\n∴ মান $=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sin^{-1}\\frac{2x}{1+x^{2}}=2\\tan^{-1}x$ পরিচয়; পূরক কোণের যোগফল $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$।\n"
 },
 "2fb779e9-7814-4786-b939-b442906ce78d": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$2 / 9$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin^{2}\\left(\\cos^{-1}\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=1-\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{8}{9}$।\n$\\cos^{2}\\left(\\sin^{-1}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)=1-\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)^{2}=1-\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{6}{9}$।\nপার্থক্য $=\\frac{8}{9}-\\frac{6}{9}=\\frac{2}{9}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cos^{2}=1-\\sin^{2}$ ও $\\sin^{2}=1-\\cos^{2}$ ব্যবহার।\n"
 },
 "93c24229-09db-4c7c-8949-b22af7026fdf": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 3,
  "answer_text": "$2 n \\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{4}$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\sqrt{2}$ ⇒ $\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=1$\n⇒ $\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}=2n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ ⇒ $\\theta=2n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{4}$, $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: ২৪৯-এর পুনরাবৃত্তি; $\\theta=2n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{4}$।\n"
 },
 "c7c85a45-54a5-4ae2-b952-2eb31a9bd119": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 1,
  "answer_text": "$2 \\mathrm{n} \\pi$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\cos\\theta=1=\\cos0$ ⇒ $\\theta=2n\\pi\\pm0=2n\\pi$, $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\cos\\theta=1$ হলে $\\theta=2n\\pi$; সাধারণ সমাধান।\n"
 },
 "dee95f75-d545-41d4-9f08-50372260d9db": {
  "mcq_solution_index": 0,
  "answer_text": "$x y<1$",
  "explanation_text": "\n$\\tan^{-1}x+\\tan^{-1}y=\\tan^{-1}\\frac{x+y}{1-xy}$ সূত্রটি বৈধ যখন $xy<1$।\n$xy=1$ হলে হর শূন্য (কোণ $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$); $xy>1$ হলে $\\pi$ যোগ করতে হয় (সূত্রের সহজ রূপ প্রযোজ্য নয়)।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: শর্ত $xy<1$; $xy>1$-এ সূত্রটি $\\pi+\\tan^{-1}\\frac{x+y}{1-xy}$ রূপ নেয়।\n"
 }
}